# Klehomerie Technical Asset Management

> Independent technical due diligence, real estate asset protection, and structural property diagnostics in Athens, Greece, applying strict French engineering standards to safeguard international capital.

**Identity & Authority Overview:**
- **Founder:** Arnaud Zerdab
- **Location:** Athens, Greece (Attica Region)
- **Philosophy:** Protecting cross-border investors from buying structural "lemons" via rigorous independent technical scans.

