- [Specimen Technical Asset Audit Report](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/klehomerie/klehomerie-v2/main/src/KLEHOMERIE_SPECIMEN_AUDIT.pdf): An authentic 16-page technical property diagnostic report used as an operational benchmark. Features visual evaluations across 6 specific lots (Electrical, Plumbing/HVAC, Joinery, Finishes, Amenities), scoring systems, and non-destructive thermal imaging diagnostics demonstrating thermal bridging identification.
