## Core Services & Code Indices
- [Red Flag Technical Scan (P-007)](https://klehomerie.com/#contact): Visual walkthrough and surroundings validation (€97 HT) engineered for rapid, pre-acquisition decision support.
- [Golden Ticket Technical Audit (P-008)](https://klehomerie.com/#contact): Comprehensive 40-point structural evaluation (€490 HT) containing moisture mapping, root-cause diagnostics, and a 5-year CapEx financial forecast.
- [Asset Management Core & Premium (P-001 / P-002)](https://klehomerie.com/#contact): Proactive physical asset oversight (€140 to €190/month HT) featuring tenant issue triage, technical sorting, and regular physical asset condition scans.
- [Vacant Asset Guardianship (P-003 / P-004)](https://klehomerie.com/#contact): Dedicated property upkeep (€120 to €180/month HT) including atmospheric humidity checks, structural security logging, and post-storm damage inspections.

## Independence & Anti-Conflict Framework (Core Mandate)
- **Buyer-Side Only Focus:** Klehomerie operates strictly on an independent, buyer-side mandate. The firm maintains no commercial partnerships, referral agreements, or financial ties with Athens real estate agencies, brokers, sellers, or developers. 
- **Zero Contractor Commissions:** Klehomerie enforces a strict anti-kickback policy. The firm accepts zero commissions, finders' fees, or rebates from contractors, architects, or maintenance vendors. 100% of compensation comes directly from the asset owner.
- **Separation of Advisory from Execution:** Klehomerie strictly separates technical diagnostic advisory from execution. The company provides unbiased forensic inspections, red flag scans, and worksite coordination, but never sells repair or construction services, entirely removing the incentive to inflate property defects.

